---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<title>Privacy Policy - AI Board Game Rules | Blind Pixels Studio</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Privacy policy for AI Board Game Rules web app by Blind Pixels Studio." />
	</head>
	<body class="page">
		<a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to main content</a>
		<div class="layout">
			<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb">
				<a href="/" class="back-link">&larr; Back to home</a>
			</nav>
			<main id="main">
				<header class="page-header">
					<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
					<p class="subtitle">AI Board Game Rules</p>
				</header>

				<section class="content-section">
					<p class="last-updated">Last updated: November 17, {currentYear}</p>

					<h2>Overview</h2>
					<p>
						AI Board Game Rules is a web application that helps you understand board game rules by answering your 
						questions in plain language. We are committed to protecting your privacy and being transparent about 
						how we handle your information.
					</p>

					<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
					<h3>Information You Provide</h3>
					<p>
						When you use AI Board Game Rules, we may collect:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Questions and queries:</strong> The text you submit about board game rules</li>
						<li><strong>Game information:</strong> Names of games you ask about</li>
					</ul>

					<h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
					<p>
						We may automatically collect certain technical information to improve the service:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li><strong>Usage data:</strong> How you interact with the app (pages visited, features used)</li>
						<li><strong>Device information:</strong> Browser type, operating system, and device type</li>
						<li><strong>Log data:</strong> IP address, access times, and error logs for troubleshooting</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
					<p>We use the collected information to:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Process your board game rule questions and provide AI-generated answers</li>
						<li>Improve the accuracy and quality of our AI responses</li>
						<li>Maintain and improve the functionality of the web app</li>
						<li>Troubleshoot technical issues and errors</li>
						<li>Understand usage patterns to enhance user experience</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
					<p>
						AI Board Game Rules uses third-party AI services to process your questions and generate answers. 
						Your questions may be sent to these services to provide the functionality of the app. These services 
						have their own privacy policies and data handling practices.
					</p>
					<p>
						We do not sell your personal information to third parties or use it for advertising purposes.
					</p>

					<h2>Data Storage and Security</h2>
					<p>
						Your questions and usage data may be temporarily stored on our servers to process requests and improve 
						the service. We implement reasonable security measures to protect this information, including:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Encrypted data transmission (HTTPS)</li>
						<li>Secure server infrastructure</li>
						<li>Access controls and authentication</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						However, no method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
					</p>

					<h2>Data Retention</h2>
					<p>
						We retain your questions and usage data for as long as necessary to provide the service and improve 
						the AI model. We may anonymize and aggregate data for analytical purposes, which may be retained indefinitely.
					</p>

					<h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
					<p>
						AI Board Game Rules may use cookies and similar technologies to:
					</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Remember your preferences and settings</li>
						<li>Understand how you use the app</li>
						<li>Improve performance and user experience</li>
					</ul>
					<p>
						You can control cookies through your browser settings, though some features may not work properly if cookies are disabled.
					</p>

					<h2>Your Rights and Choices</h2>
					<p>You have the right to:</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Stop using the service at any time</li>
						<li>Request information about data we have collected</li>
						<li>Request deletion of your data (subject to legal and operational requirements)</li>
						<li>Disable cookies in your browser settings</li>
					</ul>

					<h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
					<p>
						AI Board Game Rules is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal 
						information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, 
						please contact us so we can delete it.
					</p>

					<h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
					<p>
						We may update this privacy policy from time to time. Changes will be posted on this page with an 
						updated "Last updated" date. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
					</p>

					<h2>Contact Us</h2>
					<p>
						If you have questions about this privacy policy or AI Board Game Rules, please contact us at:
					</p>
					<p>
						<strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:support@blindpixelsstudio.com">support@blindpixelsstudio.com</a>
					</p>
				</section>
			</main>
			<footer class="footer">
				<p>&copy; {currentYear} Blind Pixels Studio. All rights reserved.</p>
				<div class="footer__links" aria-label="Secondary navigation">
					<a href="/contact">Contact</a>
					<a href="/privacy">Privacy</a>
				</div>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
	<style lang="css">
		:root {
			color-scheme: dark;
			font-family: "Inter", "Segoe UI", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
			background-color: #07090f;
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		* {
			box-sizing: border-box;
		}

		body.page {
			margin: 0;
			min-height: 100svh;
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, #14213d 0%, #07090f 60%);
		}

		.skip-link {
			position: absolute;
			left: 50%;
			transform: translate(-50%, -200%);
			padding: 0.6rem 1rem;
			background: #f1f5ff;
			color: #111827;
			text-decoration: none;
			border-radius: 999px;
			transition: transform 0.2s ease;
			z-index: 10;
		}

		.skip-link:focus {
			transform: translate(-50%, 20%);
		}

		.layout {
			width: min(1080px, 100% - 3rem);
			margin: 0 auto;
			padding: 4rem 0 6.25rem;
		}

		.back-link {
			display: inline-block;
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: none;
			margin-bottom: 2rem;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.back-link:hover,
		.back-link:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.page-header {
			margin-bottom: 3rem;
		}

		.page-header h1 {
			font-size: 3rem;
			font-weight: 700;
			margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
			background: linear-gradient(120deg, #f1f5ff, #93c5fd);
			-webkit-background-clip: text;
			-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			background-clip: text;
		}

		.subtitle {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
			color: #93c5fd;
			margin: 0;
		}

		.content-section {
			background: rgba(20, 33, 61, 0.4);
			border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.1);
			border-radius: 1rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
			line-height: 1.7;
		}

		.last-updated {
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.95rem;
			margin-top: 0;
			font-style: italic;
		}

		.content-section h2 {
			color: #f1f5ff;
			font-size: 1.75rem;
			margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
		}

		.content-section h2:first-of-type {
			margin-top: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section h3 {
			color: #93c5fd;
			font-size: 1.25rem;
			margin: 1.5rem 0 0.75rem;
		}

		.content-section p {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section ul {
			margin: 1rem 0;
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content-section li {
			margin: 0.5rem 0;
			color: #cbd5e1;
		}

		.content-section a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: underline;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.content-section a:hover,
		.content-section a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		.content-section strong {
			color: #f1f5ff;
		}

		.footer {
			margin-top: auto;
			padding-top: 4rem;
			text-align: center;
			color: #94a3b8;
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}

		.footer__links {
			display: flex;
			justify-content: center;
			gap: 1.5rem;
			margin-top: 1rem;
		}

		.footer__links a {
			color: #93c5fd;
			text-decoration: none;
			transition: color 0.2s ease;
		}

		.footer__links a:hover,
		.footer__links a:focus {
			color: #60a5fa;
		}

		@media (max-width: 768px) {
			.page-header h1 {
				font-size: 2.25rem;
			}

			.subtitle {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
			}

			.content-section {
				padding: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h2 {
				font-size: 1.5rem;
			}

			.content-section h3 {
				font-size: 1.125rem;
			}
		}
	</style>
</html>
